@startuml seq1_region_policy_and_voucher_purchase
title 지역 정책 확인 - 상품권 잔액 확인 - 추가 구매

skinparam style strictuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam BoxPadding 12
skinparam defaultFontName Malgun Gothic
autonumber

actor "사용자" as User
participant ":UserService" as UserService <<component>>
participant ":SearchService" as SearchService <<component>>
participant ":VoucherService" as VoucherService <<component>>
participant ":EventBus" as EventBus <<component>>
participant ":ManagerSystem" as ManagerSystem <<component>>
participant ":PaymentService" as PaymentService <<component>>
database "DataBase" as DB <<database>>
actor "금융 시스템" as FinancialSystem

== 1. 지역 선택 및 지역 정책 확인 ==
User -> UserService : 지역 정책 확인 (지역 선택)
activate UserService
UserService -> SearchService : 지역 정책 요청
activate SearchService
deactivate UserService
SearchService -> EventBus : 지역 정책 요청
activate EventBus
deactivate SearchService
EventBus -> ManagerSystem : 지역 정책 요청
deactivate EventBus
activate ManagerSystem
ManagerSystem -> DB : 지역 정책 요청
activate DB
deactivate ManagerSystem
DB -->> ManagerSystem : 지역 정책 반환
activate ManagerSystem
deactivate DB
ManagerSystem -->> EventBus : 지역 정책 반환
deactivate ManagerSystem
activate EventBus
EventBus -->> SearchService : 지역 정책 반환
activate SearchService
deactivate EventBus
SearchService -->> UserService : 지역 정책 반환
activate UserService
deactivate SearchService
UserService -->> User : 정책 화면 표시
deactivate UserService

== 2. 지역 상품권 잔액 확인 ==
User -> UserService : 상품권 잔액 확인
activate UserService
UserService -> VoucherService : 상품권 잔액 요청
deactivate UserService
activate VoucherService
VoucherService -> EventBus : 상품권 잔액 요청
deactivate VoucherService
activate EventBus
EventBus -> ManagerSystem : 상품권 잔액 요청
deactivate EventBus
activate ManagerSystem
ManagerSystem -> DB : 잔액 정보 요청
activate DB
deactivate ManagerSystem
DB -->> ManagerSystem : 잔액 반환
activate ManagerSystem
deactivate DB
ManagerSystem -->> EventBus : 잔액 반환
deactivate ManagerSystem
activate EventBus
EventBus -->> VoucherService : 잔액 반환
activate VoucherService
deactivate EventBus
VoucherService -->> UserService : 잔액 반환
activate UserService
deactivate VoucherService
UserService -->> User : 잔액 표시
deactivate UserService

== 3. 상품권 추가 구매 ==
User -> UserService : 추가 구매 요청 (금액, 결제수단)
activate UserService
UserService -> VoucherService : 구매 요청
deactivate UserService
activate VoucherService
VoucherService -> EventBus : 구매 요청
deactivate VoucherService
activate EventBus
EventBus -> ManagerSystem : 구매 요청
deactivate EventBus
activate ManagerSystem
ManagerSystem -> DB : 사용자 구매 이력 조회
deactivate ManagerSystem
activate DB
DB -->> ManagerSystem : 당월 누적 구매액
activate ManagerSystem
deactivate DB
ManagerSystem -> ManagerSystem : 지역 정책 대비 구매 한도 검증

alt 구매 한도 이내
  ManagerSystem -->> EventBus : 결제 요청
  deactivate ManagerSystem
  activate EventBus
  EventBus -> PaymentService : 결제 요청 전달
  deactivate EventBus
  activate PaymentService
  PaymentService -> FinancialSystem : 결제 정보 전달
  deactivate PaymentService
  activate FinancialSystem
  FinancialSystem -->> PaymentService : 결제 승인
  deactivate FinancialSystem
  activate PaymentService
  PaymentService -->> EventBus : 결제 결과 반환
  deactivate PaymentService
  activate EventBus
  EventBus -->> VoucherService : 결제 결과 반환
  activate VoucherService
  deactivate EventBus
  VoucherService -->> UserService : 구매 완료 (갱신 잔액)
  activate UserService
  deactivate VoucherService
  UserService -->> User : 구매 결과 표시
  deactivate UserService
else 구매 한도 초과
  activate ManagerSystem
  ManagerSystem -->> EventBus : 결제 거절
  deactivate ManagerSystem
  activate EventBus
  EventBus -->> VoucherService : 거절 사유 반환
  activate VoucherService
  deactivate EventBus
  VoucherService -->> UserService : 거절 사유 반환
  activate UserService
  deactivate VoucherService
  UserService -->> User : 한도 초과 안내
  deactivate UserService
end

@enduml
